(97, 32, 'The Hallway (Stormester Season 1)', 'hallway', '097_the_hallway_stormester_i.jpg', '097_the_hallway_stormester_i_thumb.jpg', NULL, 'The hallway is a small space at the bottom of the stairs in the Stormester house used for the production of tasks during season 1.|The only features of note are a portrait of Lasse and Mark on the wall, and a small side table beneath the window, where the contestants usually find the task brief, plus any necessary props, for their task.|Given the small size of the space, it is typically where homework tasks are assigned, or merely acts as the starting point for tasks which primarily take place elsewhere. ', 'The space is first seen during the \'<a href=\"/task.php?id=567\">Do something that will look impressive in reverse</a>\' task, in the first episode of season 1.'),
(98, 32, 'The Playhouse (Stormester Season 1)', 'playhouse', '098_the_playhouse_stormester_i.jpg', '098_the_playhouse_stormester_i_thumb.jpg', NULL, 'The playhouse is a brightly coloured, plastic playhouse, located in the back garden of the Stormester season 1 house.|It is labelled with Mark\'s name, suggesting that this is where he is required to live at the house.', 'The playhouse is only used as a key task location during the \'<a href=\"/task.php?id=577\">Light a candle using a cupcake</a>\' task, in the third episode of season 1.'),
(99, 32, 'The Shed (Stormester Season 1)', 'shed', '099_the_shed_stormester_i.jpg', '099_the_shed_stormester_i_thumb.jpg', NULL, 'The shed is a pretty standard wooden shed with double doors, located in the back garden of the Stormester season 1 house.|Although not often a primary space used for tasks in itself, it is full of assorted equipment and supplies which the contestants are free to use in many other tasks.', 'The shed is first seen in the \'<a href=\"https://taskmaster.info/task.php?id=580\">Get the potato into the hole</a>\' task, in the third episode of season 1, though it is not a primary location for that task.|Its sole appearance as a primary task location is during the \'<a href=\"/task.php?id=586\">Surprise Mark</a>\' task, in episode 5 of season 1.'),
(100, 33, 'The Hallway (Stormester Season 2)', 'hallway', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The hallway is the space into which the front door of the house opens, and which provides access to most of the other rooms in the house, and the stairs which lead to the upper floor.', NULL);
